+  /**
+   * Extracts the stored identifier from a client-presented token string.
+   *
+   * JWT access tokens are stored by their jti claim, and encrypted refresh
+   * tokens by the identifier inside the ciphertext. Opaque strings are
+   * returned unchanged so existing lookups keep working.
